<title>MALAYSIA: BADMINTON-RESULTS OF MALAYSIAN OPEN FINALS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-RESULTS OF MALAYSIAN OPEN FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>KOTA KINABALU, Malaysia 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the</p>
<p>final matches in the Malaysian Open badminton tournament on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>5/8-Hermawan Susanto (Indonesia) beat 3/4 Peter Gade</p>
<p>Christensen 15-11 15-11</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>1-Ricky Subagja/Rexy Mainaky (Indonesia) beat 2-Antonious</p>
<p>Budi/Denny Kantono (Indonesia) 17-15 15-12</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>1-Ge Fei/Gu Jun (China) beat Liu Lu/Qiang Hong (China) 15-7</p>
<p>15-1</p>
</text>
